=\"I Kings 20:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.9\">20:9</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.9\">2 K 22:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.20\">20</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.16\">2 Ch 34:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.28\">28</a>), but <em>answer</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:30\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.30\">1 S 17:30</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.11\">2 S 3:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.13\">24:13</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.12\">1 Ch 21:12</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.6\">1 K 12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.9\">9</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.6\">2 Ch 10:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.9\">9</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.16\">12:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.20\">Ne 2:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.13\">Pr 18:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.11\">27:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.28\">Is 41:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.11\">Ez 9:11</a> (Dr<sup>Sm p. 190</sup> explains the phrase as <em>turn back with a word</em>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ענה (לא) דבר</span> <em>answer something</em> or <em>nothing</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.21\">1 K 18:21</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:36\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.36\">2 K 18:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:42\" href=\"/Psalms.119.42\">ψ 119:42</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.21\">Is 36:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.20\">Je 44:20</a> vid. <strong>IV. 6</strong>; <span dir=\"rtl\">השׁיב דברים</span> <em>return words</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:8\" href=\"/Exodus.19.8\">Ex 19:8</a> (E) <a data-ref=\