y 17:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.9\">Dt 17:9</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.11\">11</a>."}],"num":"h."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>theme, story</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָחַשׁ לִבִּי דָּבָר טוֹב</span> my heart swells with a <em>good theme</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:2\" href=\"/Psalms.45.2\">ψ 45:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבַר גְּבוּרוֹת</span> <em>the story of his great might</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:4\" href=\"/Job.41.4\">Jb 41:4</a>."}],"num":"i."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>word of God</em>, as a divine communication in the form of commandments, prophecy, and words of help to his people, used 394 times. This word is communicated in several ways:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">ויהי דבר י׳ אל</span> <em>then the word of Yahweh came unto</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.10\">1 S 15:10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.4\">2 S 7:4</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.3\">1 Ch 17:3</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.11\">1 K 6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.20\">13:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.1\">16:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.2\">17:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.17\">21:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.28\">28</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.2\">2 Ch 11:2</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">האלהים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.22\">1 K 12:22</a>); cf.<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.8\">1 Ch 22:8</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> by confusion), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.4\">Is 38:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:4\" href=\"/Jeremia